# Working notes and superseded scratch SQL — kept on disk, not versioned.
# migration.sql predates supabase/migrations/ and would re-open public reads
# on mcq_* if run; the numbered migrations are the source of truth.
PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md
grillingResult.md
migration.sql

# Database dumps — pg_dump output from scripts/backup-db.bat and anywhere
# else. These contain student PII and must never enter the repository;
# they live on disk (ideally off-machine) and get rebuilt on demand.
backup_*.sql
# Provision/upgrade plans and backup/adoption evidence are operator records and may contain infrastructure metadata.
provisioning-reports/
upgrade-evidence/
# Browser E2E — local credential file, never commit
e2e/admin-creds.json
e2e/downloads/
e2e/live-url.txt

# Supabase CLI working state (project link + version probe) — machine-local
supabase/.temp/
